<section class="section" id="story">
  <div class="wrap split">
    {% include "partials/frame.liquid", img: "/assets/img/web/hero-pass-1000.jpg", ratio: "bike", alt: "Two riders on an alpine valley road" %}
    <div>
      <h2 class="h2">Two friends. One shared passion.</h2>
      <div class="prose mt-3">
        <p>We grew up in the Swiss Alps and found cycling together at a time when road riding was a niche and gravel bikes did not exist as a category. We raced locally, climbed passes, travelled by bike and built our own frames in steel, aluminium and later carbon.</p>
        <p>One of us studied materials science and wanted to know how a bike works. The other studied architecture and wanted to know why a product feels right. SENDA is where those two questions meet.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="text-link mt-3" style="display:inline-block" href="/story.html">Read the full story</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--stone" id="engineering">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head"><h2 class="h2">Engineering and materials</h2><p class="lead">Efficient power transfer, precise handling, balance over long distances. Carbon is laid where it does work and left out where it doesn't.</p></div>
    <div class="dims" style="--dims: 3">
      <div class="dim"><span class="dim__value">&lt; 7 kg</span><span class="dim__label">Target weight, SENDA Road top build</span></div>
      <div class="dim"><span class="dim__value">1207 g</span><span class="dim__label">ORMA Momentum 45 wheelset</span></div>
      <div class="dim"><span class="dim__value">2026</span><span class="dim__label">Test bikes on the road since</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="design">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head"><h2 class="h2">Design</h2><p class="lead">Performance does not need to be loud. Quiet lines, balanced proportions and surfaces that age well.</p></div>
    <div class="kits">
      <div class="kit"><h3 class="h3">Clear engineering</h3><p class="small mt-2">Every fibre has a purpose. We combine advanced carbon with a precise construction to put performance where it matters.</p></div>
      <div class="kit"><h3 class="h3">Refined design</h3><p class="small mt-2">Beautiful without distraction, timeless beyond trends. Four finishes, one frame.</p></div>
      <div class="kit"><h3 class="h3">Direct to rider</h3><p class="small mt-2">More value in the bike, less in the layers around it. We sell directly and invest in development, materials and quality.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

